  "phrases": [
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "text": "Ever notice how many casinos seem to forget one tiny invention, the clock?",
      "start": 0.04,
      "end": 4.216,
      "wordRange": [
        0,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "no-accident",
      "text": "That's not exactly an accident.",
      "start": 4.446,
      "end": 5.696,
      "wordRange": [
        13,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-cues",
      "text": "Traditional casino design often kept clocks and windows scarce, removing obvious clues for how long you've been inside.",
      "start": 5.897,
      "end": 11.862,
      "wordRange": [
        18,
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "constant-environment",
      "text": "The lights stay the same, the machines keep flashing, and the outside world basically disappears.",
      "start": 12.108,
      "end": 17.108,
      "wordRange": [
        36,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-distortion",
      "text": "So 20 minutes can start feeling a lot like 2 hours.",
      "start": 17.389,
      "end": 20.175,
      "wordRange": [
        51,
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "twist",
      "text": "But here's the twist. Not every modern casino follows this rule.",
      "start": 20.42,
      "end": 23.634,
      "wordRange": [
        62,
        72
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "modern-casino",
      "text": "Some newer casinos deliberately use daylight, open spaces, and even clocks because making you comfortable can work too.",
      "start": 23.964,
      "end": 30.109,
      "wordRange": [
        73,
        90
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "myth-correction",
      "text": "So casinos don't literally ban clocks.",
      "start": 30.384,
      "end": 32.512,
      "wordRange": [
        91,
        96
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "final-idea",
      "text": "The real trick is simpler. Control what you notice, keep you immersed, and make the outside world feel very, very far away.",
      "start": 32.547,
      "end": 39.385,
      "wordRange": [
        97,
        118
      ]
    }
  ],
